---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How Deals For Moms makes money, which affiliate networks are used, and what that does and does not change.">
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:48px">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p>Deals For Moms earns money through affiliate links. When you click a product link on this site and buy something, I may receive a commission from the retailer or the network. This never changes what you pay.</p>
      <h2>Networks used</h2>
      <p>Mavely, ShopYourLikes and BrandCycle.</p>
      <h2>What commission does not buy</h2>
      <p>No retailer or brand pays for a post, a placement, or a positive write-up on this site. A product appears here because I found it marked down, not because someone sponsored it. Commission rates play no part in what gets covered.</p>
      <h2>Where you will see this</h2>
      <p>Every page carrying affiliate links shows a disclosure above the first link, before you can click it, as required by the FTC Endorsement Guides (16 CFR Part 255).</p>
      <h2>Prices</h2>
      <p>Clearance prices change constantly and vary between stores. Every price on this site is what I saw at a specific store on a specific date. Always check the tag before you buy.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
